## Security Considerations

### Broker Credentials
- **Storage:** Google Secret Manager (encrypted at rest)
- **Access:** IAM service accounts only (no human access)
- **Rotation:** 90-day automatic rotation (Q3 2026)
- **OAuth:** Zerodha/Upstox use OAuth 2.0 (tokens auto-refresh)

### Order Validation
- **Pre-flight checks:**
  - Sufficient funds (call broker API)
  - Symbol validity (NSE/BSE master list)
  - Quantity limits (max 10,000 shares/order)
  - Price limits (±20% circuit filter)

- **Post-execution:**
  - Order ID verification
  - Status polling (every 1s for 60s)
  - Failure logging + alerts

### Risk Guardrails
- **Max position size:** ₹5 Lakh per symbol
- **Max portfolio value:** ₹50 Lakh per user (STARTER tier)
- **Daily loss limit:** 5% of portfolio value
- **Market hours:** 9:15 AM - 3:30 PM IST only

